thesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"341dd891eed2b080\" href=\"?note=341dd891eed2b080\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-expansion\">57-df-herbrand-expansion</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\">\\(\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\)</span> 为互异变量列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QFree}(\\psi)\">\\(\\mathrm{QFree}(\\psi)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi=\\exists x_1\\cdots\\exists x_n\\psi\">\\(\\varphi=\\exists x_1\\cdots\\exists x_n\\psi\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\models\\varphi\">\\(\\Phi\\models\\varphi\\)</span>。有限非空析取按从左到右加括号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists k\\ge1\\;\\exists(\\vec t^{(1)},\\ldots,\\vec t^{(k)})\\in((\\mathrm{Term}^0_S)^n)^k\\quad\\Phi\\models\\bigvee_{j=1}^k\\psi[t^{(j)}_1/x_1]\\cdots[t^{(j)}_n/x_n].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists k\\ge1\\;\\exists(\\vec t^{(1)},\\ldots,\\vec t^{(k)})\\in((\\mathrm{Term}^0_S)^n)^k\\quad\\Phi\\models\\bigvee_{j=1}^k\\psi[t^{(j)}_1/x_1]\\cdots[t^{(j)}_n/x_n].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>存在见证的有限基项析取需要全称背景理论及非空 Herbrand 论域；不对任意背景理论断言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"